        &\le \prod_{i \in [r-1]} \exp(-\eta d (1+\eps)^{\ell_i}) \cdot \Pr\left[\ell(u_r) = \ell_r \Big\vert \mathcal{A}_{r-1} \cap \calB_{r}\right] \\
        &\le \prod_{i \in [r]} \exp(-\eta d (1+\eps)^{\ell_i}),
    \end{align*}
